04:02.380 --> 04:04.290
Hey, Sakura!

04:04.290 --> 04:06.500
Ya wanna split this watermelon with me?

04:06.500 --> 04:08.790
Congratulations, Ryunosuke!
That's correct!

04:08.790 --> 04:10.880
