07:18.540 --> 07:21.170
Oh come on, this is just ridiculous.

07:23.040 --> 07:25.630
The charming young lady
with a frou-frou style!

07:25.630 --> 07:27.920
From class 2-7: Ran!

07:33.380 --> 07:35.210
The master of power and prettiness!

07:35.210 --> 07:37.670
Class 2-4's secretary: Shinobu!

07:37.670 --> 07:39.330
MISS SHINOBUUUUU!

07:39.580 --> 07:41.290
I LOVE YOUUUUU!

07:41.920 --> 07:45.500
<b>KAPOW!</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:43.790
Thank you very muuuuch!
Aw shucks, I'm really not made out for this...<b></b>

07:43.790 --> 07:45.500
Aw shucks, I'm really not made out for this...

07:45.670 --> 07:48.960
