from outer space!

07:49.670 --> 07:52.170
From Class 2-4: Lum!

07:53.710 --> 07:54.960
Yippeeeeee!

07:53.710 --> 07:55.920
<b>WHOO</b>

07:56.580 --> 07:58.040
Friggin' Lum!

07:58.040 --> 08:00.710
How's she getting more
damn cheers than I did?!

08:00.710 --> 08:02.460
I'm gonna wipe the floor with her!

08:02.750 --> 08:05.580
