the stormy transfer student!

08:06.920 --> 08:11.380
From Class 2-4 and
the seaside cafe: Ryunosuke!

08:12.040 --> 08:12.880
Ryunosuke!

08:12.880 --> 08:14.790
We love you Ryunosuke!

08:15.000 --> 08:17.790
