ya better take the top spot!

08:18.670 --> 08:19.880
Old man...

08:21.130 --> 08:23.040
Oh my god! This is a bikini!

08:23.250 --> 08:25.540
Am I really gonna get to wear it?!

08:25.710 --> 08:27.630
YOU CHOWDERHEAD!

08:25.710 --> 08:27.630
