08:39.500 --> 08:42.540
Wh-what I wear when it's
time for a showdown...

08:43.880 --> 08:45.830
You're were right, old man.

08:45.830 --> 08:47.750
This here is an old fashioned showdown!

08:47.750 --> 08:50.170
