the chest binding wrap!

08:54.380 --> 08:57.580
Heh. This outfit was made for
gettin' rough and rowdy!

08:57.880 --> 09:00.460
Squee! You're so amazing, Ryunosuke!
I can't imagine coming out dressed like that...<b></b>

09:00.460 --> 09:02.710
