09:02.880 --> 09:06.210
The world of men doesn't need
any flimsy bikinis!

09:06.630 --> 09:09.290
Okay ladies, the main event will be a battle!

09:09.420 --> 09:11.880
To keep things interesting and
make a comeback victory possible,

09:11.880 --> 09:14.630
