for style and technique!

09:14.880 --> 09:17.000
It's still anybody's game here, folks!

09:17.630 --> 09:19.920
So I just gotta beat these four into the dirt?

09:19.920 --> 09:21.250
Easy-peasy.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.170
O-oh crap.

09:23.170 --> 09:25.210
I'm the weakest one here, dammit!

09:25.210 --> 09:26.630
I've got no choice!

09:27.170 --> 09:29.920
So like, let's both do our bestest, kay?

09:29.920 --> 09:31.380
Uh, sure...

09:32.000 --> 09:33.670
<b>SUUUUUUUUUUCK</b>

09:35.000 --> 09:38.130
Hot damn! That's Ryunosuke's first kiss!

09:42.000 --> 09:43.750
<b>SUUUUUUUUUUCK</b>

09:43.880 --> 09:45.420
Back off!

09:45.420 --> 09:47.170
What the heck was that supposed to be?!

09:49.040 --> 09:50.540
<b>SUUUUUUUUUUCK</b>

09:50.540 --> 09:51.750
HEY!

09:51.750 --> 09:55.080
No fair, Ran! You're absorbing
