10:55.540 --> 10:57.080
The crowd is going crazy!

10:57.540 --> 11:01.380
Queen Contest Finalists versus Wild Beasts!

11:01.380 --> 11:05.210
It's time for this no holds barred,
best of one match to begin!

11:06.250 --> 11:08.630
Gosh, what a pickle.
Right, Lummy-poo?

11:08.630 --> 11:10.210
It's all your fault, Ran!

11:10.210 --> 11:12.710
