with a swift leap into the air!

11:18.540 --> 11:19.710
Hiyaaaah!

11:19.920 --> 11:23.710
<b>WHAMO!</b>

11:20.830 --> 11:23.710
A drop kick! And it lands perfectly!

11:23.920 --> 11:26.380
Let's see what the judges award her
for style and technique points!

11:25.710 --> 11:26.670
<b>Style</b>

11:25.710 --> 11:26.670
<b>Technique</b>

11:26.670 --> 11:28.250
That's how we do it!

11:33.380 --> 11:34.500
<b>GRAAAAAWR!</b>

11:33.880 --> 11:36.000
Uh oh! Her kick had no effect!

11:37.710 --> 11:39.460
Take... THIS!

11:39.460 --> 11:40.460
Look at that!

11:40.460 --> 11:43.250
Her killer move! The Thunderbolt Chomp!

11:40.460 --> 11:43.250
<b>KILLER MOVE!</b>

11:40.460 --> 11:43.250
<b>THUNDERBOLT CHOMP!</b>

11:45.500 --> 11:46.330
<b>Ptooey!</b>

11:47.000 --> 11:47.460
