11:48.790 --> 11:51.500
Second string for
the beast team: Anaconda!

11:51.880 --> 11:52.960
Yuck, I hate snakes.

11:52.960 --> 11:54.710
Lum! Tag me in!
Got kissed... got kissed... first kiss...<b></b>

11:55.750 --> 11:57.380
I hope this works out...

11:58.880 --> 12:00.540
Hisssss!

12:00.540 --> 12:02.880
I'll have you skinned and
grilled to a crisp in no time!

12:07.670 --> 12:08.960
Oh no, Nurse Sakura!

12:08.960 --> 12:11.920
Th-this doesn't even hurt...

12:12.920 --> 12:14.790
Something's wrong.

12:14.790 --> 12:17.670
I can't muster up... any strength...

12:22.210 --> 12:23.540
Whisper, whisper, whisper.

12:25.040 --> 12:28.750
Whoa! She just earned
a heap of style points with that!

12:25.040 --> 12:28.750
<b>Style</b>

12:29.000 --> 12:30.750
Nurse Sakura!
But is something the matter?<b></b>

12:31.210 --> 12:33.790
Sakura seems to be having
a tougher time than expected!

12:35.000 --> 12:36.080
Hey! Do something ref!

12:36.080 --> 12:36.830
None of that!

12:37.670 --> 12:38.040
<b>WHACK!</b>

12:38.710 --> 12:39.750
Darling!

12:46.830 --> 12:49.170
What the hell are you doing, ape?!
Screw it, I can't watch this anymore!<b></b>

12:49.750 --> 12:52.500
LET HER GO RIGHT NOOOOW!

12:53.380 --> 12:55.210
<b>WHAP!</b>

12:58.500 --> 13:00.960
GET YOUR HANDS OFF ME, CREEP!

12:59.500 --> 13:00.960
<b>CLENCH!</b>

13:03.330 --> 13:05.920
Yikes! Where's her usual
superhuman strength?!

13:05.920 --> 13:08.630
Sakura and Shinobu are having
a hard time in the ring!

13:08.630 --> 13:10.330
I've had all I can stand of this!

13:11.330 --> 13:12.040
Hup!

13:12.040 --> 13:14.710
A mysterious masked wrestler
takes the stage!

13:14.880 --> 13:16.500
You're fighting me now!

13:19.420 --> 13:20.580
Huh? What the?

13:20.580 --> 13:22.000
OH NOOOOOOOO!

13:22.000 --> 13:24.630
Our mystery man is gone
as quickly as he came!

13:22.000 --> 13:22.210
<b>CLAP</b>

13:22.380 --> 13:22.630
<b>CLAP</b>

13:22.750 --> 13:23.000
<b>CLAP</b>

13:23.130 --> 13:23.380
<b>CLAP</b>

13:23.500 --> 13:23.750
<b>CLAP</b>

13:23.880 --> 13:24.130
<b>CLAP</b>

13:24.250 --> 13:24.500
<b>CLAP</b>

13:25.460 --> 13:28.210
Uh oh! The gorilla is going for a pinfall!

13:28.580 --> 13:29.420
One!

13:29.630 --> 13:30.580
Two!

13:31.080 --> 13:31.830
Th...

13:31.830 --> 13:34.330
NOT ON MY WATCH!

13:33.580 --> 13:34.710
<b>ZAZAPZAPZAPZAP</b>

13:34.710 --> 13:37.830
<b>ELECTRIFIED CROSS CHOP</b>

13:35.040 --> 13:36.880
It's an Electrified Cross Chop!

13:36.880 --> 13:39.500
Lum just scored some unique
technical points with that one!

13:37.830 --> 13:39.500
<b>Unique Technical</b>

13:40.210 --> 13:41.750
I can't believe I got kissed...

13:41.750 --> 13:44.960
Ryunosuke! Quit pussyfooting around
like a loser already!

13:44.960 --> 13:48.170
Kissing is just another hurdle of youth
ya were bound to clear someday!

13:48.170 --> 13:50.040
But a first kiss only comes
once in a lifetime!

13:50.040 --> 13:51.750
Enough of yer whining!

13:51.750 --> 13:53.380
GET IN THERE!

13:51.830 --> 13:53.380
<b>FLIIIIING!</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:57.670
This ain't the time to hesitate!

14:04.080 --> 14:05.250
<b>KABAM!</b>

14:05.540 --> 14:08.170
Ryunosuke's in trouble!
Can she get back up?!

14:08.170 --> 14:11.040
Stand up! Get on your feet, Ryunosuke!

14:11.040 --> 14:14.080
I thought you were gonna win this thing!

14:15.790 --> 14:18.040
Yikes! The tiger's going for a pinfall!

14:18.040 --> 14:19.580
Like hell you will!

14:19.750 --> 14:21.790
<b>ZAPZAPZAPZAP</b>

14:22.250 --> 14:24.330
We're in some deep shit...

14:25.170 --> 14:26.580
I'm getting outta here!

14:27.750 --> 14:29.040
<b>SMIRK</b>

14:29.040 --> 14:30.580
<b>GRAAAAAWR!</b>

14:36.580 --> 14:38.830
Eeeeek! Somebody save me!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.920
I've already got my hands full over here!

14:41.170 --> 14:42.580
Pwetty pwease?

14:42.580 --> 14:45.080
Here's an idea! You should just
suck the energy out of the animals!

14:45.080 --> 14:47.420
WHY THE HELL DO I GOTTA KISS
THESE FRIGGIN' UGLY THINGS?!

14:47.420 --> 14:49.130
WHATEVER!
THEN YOU THINK OF SOMETHING!

14:52.170 --> 14:54.210
Oh darling! Pwease help me!

14:55.080 --> 14:55.880
Okay.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.170
<b>KAPOW!</b>

14:57.790 --> 14:59.080
I've done some crazy things,

14:59.080 --> 15:01.250
but kissing animals is one line
I ain't crossing!

15:02.380 --> 15:04.290
<b>WOOOOSH</b>

15:07.750 --> 15:10.130
WHAT IS YOUR GODDAMN PROBLEM?!

15:14.210 --> 15:15.630
Holy smokes!

15:14.210 --> 15:17.920
<b>VRUMP!</b>

15:14.210 --> 15:17.920
<b>TUG TUG...</b>

15:15.630 --> 15:18.540
It looks like Sakura is back to being
her crazy strong self!

15:18.710 --> 15:20.330
<b>BLAMO!</b>

15:20.460 --> 15:21.710
What did you just do?

15:21.710 --> 15:23.420
I returned all the energy I took.

15:23.420 --> 15:25.000
Now it's Shinobu's turn!

15:28.670 --> 15:30.330
What the heck are you doing?!

15:30.330 --> 15:33.040
I'm trying to return
yer friggin' strength, dumbass!

15:33.960 --> 15:34.580
<b>CLENCH!</b>

15:35.000 --> 15:36.040
Do it now!

15:39.670 --> 15:42.880
<b>KERFLUMP!</b>

15:40.790 --> 15:42.880
Whoa! And right into a pinfall!

15:43.000 --> 15:44.000
I gotta do it now!

15:46.710 --> 15:47.580
One!

15:47.880 --> 15:48.920
Two!

15:49.380 --> 15:50.210
Th...

15:52.130 --> 15:53.420
There she goes!

15:53.420 --> 15:55.040
Shinobu's superhuman power has returned!

15:55.420 --> 15:57.580
Just look at her holding that bear
over her head!

15:57.580 --> 16:00.130
Incredible! She's the spitting image
of the legendary Kintaro!

16:00.130 --> 16:03.460
WHAT DID YOU JUST CALL MEEEEE?!

16:05.210 --> 16:07.000
<b>FLAWOMP!</b>

16:09.880 --> 16:11.500
SHINOBUUUUU!

16:11.500 --> 16:12.630
GOTCHA!

16:16.130 --> 16:18.670
HEAD-ON COLLISIOOOOON!

16:16.130 --> 16:21.080
<b>KERSMAAAAAASH!</b>

16:18.670 --> 16:20.080
Oof, that's gotta hurt!

16:20.080 --> 16:23.670
Sakura and Shinobu just unleashed
a real banger of a combo move!

16:23.670 --> 16:25.580
Whoa! Hold on a sec!

16:28.420 --> 16:30.000
<b>GLOMP!</b>

16:31.170 --> 16:33.250
Lum strikes again!
This time with a Lightning Kick!

16:31.170 --> 16:33.250
<b>LIGHTNING KICK</b>

16:34.080 --> 16:36.130
CUT IT OOOOOUT!

16:37.080 --> 16:38.080
Now's my chance!

16:38.080 --> 16:39.920
Get back here youuuuu!

16:39.920 --> 16:42.790
Whoa, Ryunosuke leaps out of the ring!
And makes a break for it!

16:44.580 --> 16:45.630
<b>FLIP!</b>

16:46.290 --> 16:47.630
Lemme go!

16:47.630 --> 16:49.460
This is all for the 150 thousand!

16:49.460 --> 16:50.380
Just put on a brace face and do it!

16:50.380 --> 16:51.380
150 thousand?!
Just put on a brace face and do it!<b></b>

16:51.790 --> 16:52.920
You jackass!

16:52.920 --> 16:55.250
All your support for me was
just because of the stupid money?!

16:55.250 --> 16:56.920
Good work, old-timer!

16:56.920 --> 16:59.330
Just keep her nice and still for me!

17:01.580 --> 17:03.000
Stop trying to kiss our Ryunosuke!

17:01.580 --> 17:05.000
<b>JABBER</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:04.080
Dammit! Get the hell off me!
She doesn't like it!<b></b>

17:04.080 --> 17:04.750
Dammit! Get the hell off me!
Stay away from her!<b></b>

17:05.000 --> 17:06.080
<b>BASLUUUUUUMP</b>

17:06.670 --> 17:07.790
Watch out below!

17:08.080 --> 17:09.000
<b>EEEK</b>

17:14.960 --> 17:17.250
<b>WOOOOSH</b>

17:17.420 --> 17:20.040
Aw man, there goes my second kiss...

17:20.790 --> 17:22.790
S-screw this...

17:23.420 --> 17:24.880
Screw this!

17:26.630 --> 17:29.290
GODDAAAAAAAAMMIT!

17:29.960 --> 17:33.880
<b>FLING!</b>

17:30.540 --> 17:31.830
Ryunosuke strikes back!

17:31.830 --> 17:34.920
And sends the anaconda flying
through the air with a powerful blow!

17:35.920 --> 17:37.130
Time to kick butt!

17:37.130 --> 17:38.130
Yeah!

17:44.210 --> 17:46.170
<b>KERSMACKKKKKKKK!</b>

17:48.960 --> 17:51.960
One! Two! Three!

17:52.250 --> 17:55.250
Four! Five! Six!

17:55.750 --> 17:58.670
Seven! Eight! Nine!

17:59.000 --> 18:00.000
Ten!

18:01.960 --> 18:04.710
We did it!

18:09.960 --> 18:11.750
It's a team victory!

18:12.580 --> 18:13.880
Wait a minute.

18:13.880 --> 18:15.710
What exactly do you mean
by "team" victory?!

18:15.710 --> 18:18.080
I thought we were here to crown
the School Queen!

18:18.080 --> 18:19.830
Yeah! What they said!

18:20.250 --> 18:22.290
Allow me to explain.

18:22.290 --> 18:23.630
Mr. Principal?

18:23.630 --> 18:27.460
All five of you put up a very admirable fight.

18:27.460 --> 18:29.540
It was absolutely fantastic.

18:29.540 --> 18:33.670
From your finely-honed skills
and well-tempered muscles...

18:33.670 --> 18:36.670
the impact of it all distracted us
from keeping track of scores.

18:36.670 --> 18:39.750
If you forgot to give out points,
then just say so, dammit!

18:40.080 --> 18:45.210
Hold on, then the title of Tomo-1 Queen
that I desperately wanted for myself is...

18:45.540 --> 18:47.960
Congratulations on your team victory!

18:47.960 --> 18:48.830
CRUUUUUUUUUD!

18:48.830 --> 18:50.830
Are you saying we went through
all of that for nothing?!

18:50.830 --> 18:52.170
Don't get upset just yet!

18:52.170 --> 18:54.830
Okay ladies, please look above you!

18:55.380 --> 18:57.000
In all of those decorative balls,

18:57.000 --> 19:00.540
we've prepared 30 thousand yen
worth of prizes for each of you!

19:00.540 --> 19:04.290
30 thousand yen?
That's way cheaper than before...

19:04.290 --> 19:06.920
Whatever. It's better than nothing.

19:06.920 --> 19:08.290
Congratulations!

19:08.290 --> 19:09.210
<b>KACHUNK</b>

19:15.710 --> 19:16.750
No way...

19:16.750 --> 19:18.290
This is the prize?!

19:19.000 --> 19:20.750
This mountain of taiyaki waffles...

19:20.750 --> 19:24.000
were provided as prizes by
our wonderful sponsor, Ebiya!

19:20.750 --> 19:24.000
<b>EBIYA</b>

19:24.750 --> 19:27.330
YOU'RE JUST ASKING FOR
A BEATING,YOU JERK!

19:29.040 --> 19:31.040
Waffles!

19:32.080 --> 19:35.580
Hey, Lum! You should've
invited us to this party!

19:35.960 --> 19:37.250
It looks fun.

19:37.250 --> 19:38.960
Benten! Oyuki!

19:38.960 --> 19:40.080
Oh, Rei!

19:40.080 --> 19:41.080
Later, suckers!

19:41.080 --> 19:42.580
Get back here!

19:42.750 --> 19:44.880
Rei! Say "ahh"!

19:46.000 --> 19:47.920
Hey! What're you doing, old man?!

19:47.920 --> 19:50.630
Ryunosuke! Start grabbing all of these
so we can sell them for cash!

19:50.630 --> 19:51.750
Enough about money!

19:51.960 --> 19:55.330
Curse you, Benten!
When are you gonna give us our duel?!

19:55.330 --> 19:57.130
Miss Shinobu! I lo-

19:57.250 --> 19:58.500
<b>KAPOW!</b>

19:58.630 --> 20:01.420
Oh, dear brother?
Wherever could he be?

20:01.420 --> 20:03.250
Shu! I'm here to challenge you!

20:03.670 --> 20:05.830
Calling all sexy hunks!

20:06.130 --> 20:09.670
Hey, Sakura! Let's hang out
and eat these taiyaki waffles!

20:09.670 --> 20:11.750
Jeez, what is even going on anymore?!

20:11.750 --> 20:13.670
Such depravity...

20:17.330 --> 20:19.330
Nothing like getting rich on kickbacks!

20:20.080 --> 20:22.330
This just isn't satisfying at all!

20:24.380 --> 20:26.830
C'mon! Listen to me
when I'm talking to you!

20:26.830 --> 20:27.670
Hey!

20:44.000 --> 20:45.960
Th-that could've been dangerous!

20:46.630 --> 20:48.710
Hey, tell me.

20:49.290 --> 20:52.710
Was I able to become the Queen...
of your heart?

20:58.330 --> 21:00.710
THERE YOU ARE, YOU LITTLE SHIT!

21:00.710 --> 21:04.630
YOU BETTER HAVE A GOOD
EXPLAINATION FOR ALL THIS, MISTER!

21:09.040 --> 21:10.420
Come back!

21:10.420 --> 21:12.130
I wanna hear your answer!

21:12.130 --> 21:14.420
Daaaaaaarling!

21:16.540 --> 21:19.460
It's not enough, I want more love

21:19.460 --> 21:22.460
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

21:22.460 --> 21:25.210
So fall for me and look only at me

21:25.210 --> 21:28.210
I already love you even down to your marrow

21:39.380 --> 21:42.380
Deep in those eyes, who are you waiting for?

21:42.380 --> 21:45.330
All you've shown me is your face from the side

21:45.330 --> 21:46.750
I want to know

21:46.750 --> 21:49.080
Give me love, give me love, that's all

21:50.880 --> 21:53.960
Out of every planet it was Earth that I came to

21:53.960 --> 21:56.790
Because your presence drew me to it

21:56.790 --> 21:59.000
I want you to respond, to the vagueness

21:59.000 --> 22:00.080
To I need you

22:00.080 --> 22:01.330
I wanna solve the complication

22:01.330 --> 22:02.880
I want shared love

22:02.880 --> 22:04.540
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:04.540 --> 22:05.920
Even if we get separated

22:05.920 --> 22:07.420
C'mon c'mon, darling darling

22:07.420 --> 22:08.710
At the ends of the universe

22:08.710 --> 22:11.210
Just sew the stars and moon together

22:11.210 --> 22:13.210
And draw them close

22:13.210 --> 22:14.170
After all

22:14.170 --> 22:16.880
It's not enough, I want more love

22:16.880 --> 22:19.830
I can't imagine myself with anyone other than you

22:19.830 --> 22:22.670
So fall for me and look only at me

22:22.670 --> 22:25.500
I already love you even down to your marrow

22:25.500 --> 22:28.420
No way no way, don't run off somewhere

22:28.420 --> 22:31.250
I want to revolve around the planet known as you

22:31.250 --> 22:34.170
Hey look this way, then look that way

22:34.170 --> 22:37.290
In spite of everything, I'm just so in love with you

22:37.500 --> 22:38.960
Absolutely, absolutely

22:38.960 --> 22:40.330
I'll give you a shock

22:40.330 --> 22:41.880
Enough, enough

22:41.880 --> 22:43.290
Not enough love

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>URUSEI YATSURA</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>PART 2</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.960
<b>COMING IN 2024!</b>

22:46.580 --> 22:48.170
"Urusei Yatsura" Part 2!

22:48.170 --> 22:50.500
Coming to a TV near you in 2024!
